    "body": "Yes it's much better and requires less clumsy scripts 👍\r\n\r\nAstro can [only use stylesheets from the public directory (or absolute links) when using `<link>` tags](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/styling/#load-a-static-stylesheet-via-link-tags) so I'm using [`prepare`](https://docs.npmjs.com/cli/v9/using-npm/scripts#prepare-and-prepublish) scripts to build the library after install, then copy the themes in `specs/public/`.",
